[00:00.93]Lesson 75 | 第75课
[00:03.73]Uncomfortable shoes | 不舒服的鞋子
[00:06.98]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.38]What's wrong with the fashionable shoes? | 时髦的鞋子有什么问题?
[00:18.01]Do you have any shoes like these? | 你们有像这样的鞋子吗?
[00:22.08]What size? | 多大尺码的?
[00:23.80]Size five. | 5号。
[00:25.86]What colour? | 什么颜色?
[00:27.30]Black. | 黑色。
[00:28.91]I'm sorry. | 很抱歉。
[00:30.29]We don't have any. | 我们没有。
[00:32.85]But my sister bought this pair last month. | 但是我妹妹上个月买了一双这样的。
[00:37.52]Did she buy them here? | 她是在这儿买的吗?
[00:39.94]No, she bought them in the U. S. | 不,她是在美国买的。
[00:44.36]We had some shoes like those a month ago, but we don't have any now. | 我们一个月前有过一些像那样的鞋子,但现在没有了。
[00:51.82]Can you get a pair for me, please? | 请问您能帮我弄一双吗?
[00:55.52]I'm afraid that I can't. | 恐怕我不能。
[00:58.54]They were in fashion last year and the year before last. | 它们去年和前年都很流行。
[01:04.20]But they're not in fashion this year. | 但今年不流行了。
[01:09.10]These shoes are in fashion now. | 这些鞋子现在很流行。
[01:13.09]They look very uncomfortable. | 它们看起来非常不舒服。
[01:16.46]They are very uncomfortable. | 它们确实非常不舒服。
[01:19.48]But women always wear uncomfortable shoes! | 但女人总是穿不舒服的鞋子!